{#- ===========================================================================
  bg-backup - repository passphrase.

  This file must contain THE PASSPHRASE AND NOTHING ELSE: restic reads the
  whole file (trimming surrounding whitespace) and uses it as the key. A
  helpful header comment here would become part of the password and lock the
  host out of its own repository, which is why this template carries its
  explanation inside a Jinja comment that renders to nothing.

  Written once, at 0400, and never rewritten by Ansible afterwards - see
  tasks/credentials.yml for why overwriting it is not a password change but a
  lockout.
=========================================================================== -#}
